title: "SNP Extraction Pipeline for Pseudomonas aeruginosa"

message: "If you use this pipeline, please cite this software repository."

type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Do"
    given-names: "Thi Duyen"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7361-292X"

version: "1.0.0"

date-released: "2026-08-29"

DOI: "10.5281/zenodo.22161844"

repository-code: "https://github.com/thiduyendo/SNP_extraction_pipeline"

url: "https://github.com/thiduyendo/SNP_extraction_pipeline"

abstract: >
  A Snakemake-based workflow for extracting nucleotide-level SNP
  features from clustered and aligned protein sequences of
  Pseudomonas aeruginosa. The workflow combines protein clustering
  with CD-HIT, multiple sequence alignment with MAFFT, nucleotide
  sequence mapping, SNP extraction, and antibiotic-specific
  phenotype matrix generation.
